  "title": "The laws of nature are habits",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "8a37be91-54fb-4bd5-944b-0f118370cd4d",
      "text": "The laws of nature are not imposed prescriptions but descriptions of habits, which emerge from the cumulative social activity of occasions of experience. Laws for different domains can therefore be more or less exact.",
